  ('97261236-4488-5463-aba7-31ff0b44fad3', '211a4a9b-0b4a-557f-babf-a3510ad048a9', 'Which state is known as the ''Home of Peace and Tourism''?', '["Cross River","Bauchi","Gombe","Plateau"]'::jsonb, 3, 4, 'Plateau''s cool weather draws many visitors.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plateau_State', 'live'),
