  ('fe116ba0-5eff-5403-99fe-8807a8508d49', '211a4a9b-0b4a-557f-babf-a3510ad048a9', 'Which state is called the ''Power State''?', '["Kaduna","Kwara","Niger","Kogi"]'::jsonb, 2, 4, 'It hosts the Kainji, Jebba and Shiroro dams.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Niger_State', 'live'),
